l">North Korea launched several short-range ballistic missiles into the sea a day after the US, South Korea and Japan concluded joint military exercises Pyongyang had called provocative.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India's BRICS strategy tested with Xi, Putin set to visit</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:ca927e41d91748ef4c26fe92c6a7f95e06b12174e2e90c3b6583b1444b08b0dd</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T13:31:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-s-brics-strategy-tested-with-xi-putin-set-to-visit/a-79231879--3d59ee566cca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-s-brics-strategy-tested-with-xi-putin-set-to-visit/a-79231879?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New Delhi's "America Plus" approach sees India deepening its ties with China and Russia, while also trying to keep BRICS from turning into an anti-Western platform.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India looks to steer BRICS away from anti-Western turn</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:04c1f3ae6ea72d62f78b30c456f162f03328519efcead510ab0fb1118a7ee339</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T10:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-looks-to-steer-brics-away-from-anti-western-turn/a-79195234--e9a076e9f28e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-looks-to-steer-brics-away-from-anti-western-turn/a-79195234?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The BRICS summit 2026 takes place in Delhi this weekend. Unlike last year, Putin and Xi are expected to attend. Can India keep the expanded bloc united?</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Why North Korea's Kim Jong Un doesn't need a US deal</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:541e08d52ed93cd30537d56f9ccb56fb8ccf447120d0621c9f926d140bc7e1f7</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T10:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-kim-jong-un-doesn-t-need-a-us-deal/a-79227854--e7f102464964.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/why-north-korea-s-kim-jong-un-doesn-t-need-a-us-deal/a-79227854?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Donald Trump's overtures to North Korea's dictator have gone nowhere, with an emboldened Pyongyang accelerating its nuclear program and solidifying alliances with Russia and China.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>China angered by Taiwan VP's visit to EU democracy forum</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7e3bc3a2ee306234900890249e3709ab72a8db2de04a02e4caf2b2946434d8aa</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T10:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/china-angered-by-taiwan-vp-s-visit-to-eu-democracy-forum/a-79226311--51b6e60ff469.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/china-angered-by-taiwan-vp-s-visit-to-eu-democracy-forum/a-79226311?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Beijing has lodged a complaint with Italy and the EU over top Taiwanese officials visiting a democracy conference. The EU is navigating contentious issues with China and high-ranking Taiwanese visits are rare.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Hong Kong Tiananmen activists jailed for up to 7 years</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:03c22f21d6525c6e8a80f49ac56205266b705cf28b81d9294d5046c51bc35449</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T08:40:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-tiananmen-activists-jailed-for-up-to-7-years/a-79224243--b40cd2f6f0ea.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hong-kong-tiananmen-activists-jailed-for-up-to-7-years/a-79224243?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Three pro-democracy activists who organized annual commemorations of China's deadly 1989 Tiananmen crackdown were charged under Hong Kong's Beijing-backed national security law.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Philippines ferry fire: Search continues for dozens missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:6dbbe5d06cb1c5967ce64a802ba08598cee9dbe116112a656117ad6f2ffb6344</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-11T08:18:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/philippines-ferry-fire-search-continues-for-dozens-missing/a-79223425--fc38c9af4128.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/philippines-ferry-fire-search-continues-for-dozens-missing/a-79223425?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Firefighters searching for survivors combed through the smoking remains of a ferry off the coast of Coron island in the Philippines. Dozens of people have died, and more than 40 have been rescued.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea spends war windfall on arms, infrastructure</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c202513eaa74fbbd90e04409ccc512e81013b5aabcd71abb083d4c40d11ac328</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T14:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-spends-war-windfall-on-arms-infrastructure/a-79218305--540623f7d851.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-spends-war-windfall-on-arms-infrastructure/a-79218305?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Ukraine war and Pyongyang's alliance with Moscow have delivered an economic boost to North Korea, allowing the regime to pursue a range of long-desired projects.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>India news: Government proposes elected body for Ladakh</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d35fb48cc724517b4d3534055f6ef73f6de82b2fd89c8bdc5f50560203f2f6f8</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-10T13:05:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-news-government-proposes-elected-body-for-ladakh/live-79212708--848df6f2a45f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-news-government-proposes-elected-body-for-ladakh/live-79212708?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The government has suggested creating an elected Union Territory body. However, Ladakh leaders have expressed disappointment over the slow pace of progress. Follow DW for more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Call in China to end English's core status sparks debate</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:17723f0e4d5d9acb58bf2b7cb5cd76525edef839001b72a779f58226a392d973</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T19:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/call-in-china-to-end-english-s-core-status-sparks-debate/a-79199629--c3ac5be694ff.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/call-in-china-to-end-english-s-core-status-sparks-debate/a-79199629?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A call to downgrade English in Chinese schools is fueling discussion over its value for students, careers and China's global competitiveness in the age of AI.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>The billion-euro trade driving Europe's eels to extinction</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:63a01d78ddaa24d4f4d80db4d3fd33ad06cf9f4f95cdef512784b2e3c1b1fc65</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T08:36:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/the-billion-euro-trade-driving-europe-s-eels-to-extinction/a-78523145--e574ad564b10.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/the-billion-euro-trade-driving-europe-s-eels-to-extinction/a-78523145?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Traffickers are making big bucks smuggling millions of critically endangered eels across continents, using suitcases on planes and legal loopholes to deliver them to dinnerplates. Where are the smuggling hotspots?</summary><category term="Environment" /></entry><entry><title>Trafficked into fraud: An African crisis situation in Cambodia</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:bacfbbc8047ba53a96d798f79be5522bc4237f3356e13c84d0b1b37c42e07586</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-09T08:27:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/trafficked-into-fraud-an-african-crisis-situation-in-cambodia/a-79189967--d423991a2cca.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/trafficked-into-fraud-an-african-crisis-situation-in-cambodia/a-79189967?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Cambodia's crackdown on scam operators is stranding young African trafficking victims in the Asian country with no money, no passport and no prospects.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Afghanistan's women: A national soccer team without a home</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f719fc0e9b0b3d9ebe18e91a023f58564bc7940c6038ae1d64c8cc4316ce9561</id><updated>2026-09-12T12:14:41Z</updated><published>2026-09-08T11:03:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/afghanistan-s-women-a-national-soccer-team-without-a-home/a-79139500--7cfb666b9c3a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/afghanistan-s-women-a-national-soccer-team-without-a-home/a-79139500?maca=en-rss-en-asia-5133-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The Afghan women's national football team has finally been officially recognized by FIFA. Now the players want to make history both on and off the field.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>How climate change and food insecurity could fuel future conflicts</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:8f04eab3c6bb950309b7f4a82526b088a